* Modded-British preamp, stage 3 of 3: V3A, V3B (the cathode follower), the SAT clipper, the VOICE switch, the tone stack, the Master and the
* output node, with the end of the Clean chain. V2B's plate (stage 2) arrives through VL3 into the Gain network and V1B's plate (stage 1) through
* VL5 into C9. See preamp.net for how the netlist is split.

.nodes x x2 x3 p3 p5 gt gw ng4 p4 k4 c43 vb s33 sat sat2 c42 tt m w3 n1b n2b wm ms mw cd cl mo

V VRAIL x 211.2 430
C C28 x 0 10.417u
R R34 x x2 10k
C C29 x2 0 22u
R R43 x2 x3 10k
C C30 x3 0 100u

S VL3 p3 1 0
S VL5 p5 1 0
C C19 p3 gt 2n2
R VR_GT gt gw 1
R VR_GB gw 0 1
R R30 gw ng4 470k
C C26 gw ng4 500p
R R28 ng4 0 470k

T V3A ng4 p4 k4 12AX7
R R27 x2 p4 100k
C C27 x2 p4 500p
R R29 k4 0 820
C C24 k4 0 0.68u
T V3B p4 x3 vb 12AX7
R R31 vb 0 100k
R SW_V3A k4 c43 1
C C43 c43 0 470u
R SW_V3B vb c42 1e12
C C42 c42 0 500p

R R33 vb s33 10k
C C25 s33 sat 100n
R SW_SAT sat sat2 1e12
D DZ1 sat2 0 SIGNAL
D DZ2 0 sat2 SIGNAL
R R38 sat2 0 1M

C C4 vb tt 500p
R R8 vb m 33k
R VR_TT tt w3 1
R VR_TB w3 n1b 1
C C1 m n1b 22n
R VR_BASS n1b n2b 1
R VR_MIDT n2b wm 1
R VR_MIDB wm 0 1
C C6 m wm 22n
R R59 w3 ms 220k
R R32 ms 0 1M
R VR_MT ms mw 1
R VR_MB mw 0 1

C C9 p5 cd 0.022u
R R15 cd cl 470k
R R22 cl 0 470k
R SW_CLN_OUT cl mo 1
R SW_BE_OUT mw mo 1e12
R RMLOAD mo 0 1M
